====🔧 The past, present & future 🔧====
We are grateful to everyone for participating in Early Access and following the development of our game! Thanks to you, Best Forklift Operator is much better and bigger than we planned. On this occasion, we also made sure that the update to version 1.00 gives you something new, fresh and exciting.
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41272375/ca6c7d3cd658cdcffb2768ed5e598a0234aa1fc3.gif

We believe that the difference between what was released in April and today is visible to everyone. We did everything to ensure that each update gives you something convenient and that the game could be better and bigger.
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41272375/84e58fd5643215551295bd44d4e8b75400959fe4.gif

Leaving Early Access is a big event for us. From now on, our game is officially released as a finished title in a very competitive environment. We are glad that everyone who has already bought the game will be able to update it to version 1.00 for free, and we are happy that we can present it in this version to completely new players. 
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41272375/7a5af48336147b272d397ef408c161cebc667b72.gif

====🔧 What awaits you at 1.00? 🔧====
💪 Arcade mode called Make a mess! in which, instead of stacking loads in the warehouse, you have to make as much of a mess as possible!
💪 New, fourth Forklift.
💪 Steam Leaderboards, so you will be able to compete with the whole world!
💪 Steam Achievements to see if you really are the Best Forklift Operator!

On this special occasion, we have a new trailer:
[previewyoutube=WAwIECyub3w;full][/previewyoutube]

====🔧 What awaits you at 1.00? 🔧====
We also want to summarize the path that the Best Forklift Operator project has gone through in recent months. It was a path full of many obstacles and challenges, and we are all the more glad that you are here with us! So that's how it was…

April 2022  - Early Access premiere
✔️ Play the whole game in VR (Oculus Quest goggles & controllers support) or on the flat screen;
✔️ Two warehouses;
✔️ Two forklifts;
✔️ Five missions in each warehouse + two extra “random” missions;
✔️ Earning currency and changing the colors of the forklift;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41272375/abb03d1e8cfa05216a92173bbe354e83176502b8.gif

April 2022 - Update 1
✔️ Support for HTC Vive (Wands) goggles & controllers;
✔️ Support for Valve Index (Knuckles) goggles & controllers;
✔️ Higher display resolutions (Confirmed resolutions are 21:9 - 2560×1080, 3440×1440, 2560×1440 and 16:9 - 3840×2160);
✔️ VR Pointer;
✔️ Cargo models optimization;
✔️ VR Interface optimization;
✔️ Bug fixes;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41272375/f165d3c42bd864736c5dce7f977962e1bfec1bbd.gif

May 2022 - Update 2
✔️ Support for Point shop;
✔️ Support for Community Items (Avatars, badges, trading cards, backgrounds and more!);
✔️ Support for Thrustmaster Ferrari 458 (Xbox 360 model);
✔️ Support for Logitech G29;
✔️ Support for Thrustmaster T150 Racing Wheel;
✔️ Support for Thrustmaster T300 RS Racing Wheel;
✔️ General, universal steering wheel support, supported by a new in-game controller;
✔️ Support for VR goggles with a steering wheel in the beta version (experimental);
✔️ New Key Bindings;
✔️ User presets for gamepads/keyboards;
✔️ Full German localization;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41272375/0d0979a1f1026ab78d0cabc861f3b48e80d3159b.gif

June 2022 - Update 3
✔️ Open space added to the first warehouse;
✔️ Open space added to the second warehouse;
✔️ Third forklift;
✔️ Refresh, revisited Warehouse 1;
✔️ More presets for VR;
✔️ Bug fixes;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41272375/092ab69fef1d7031c64459133064356931d7740a.gif

June 2022 - Update 4
✔️ Third, the largest warehouse with open space, and new six missions;
✔️ Navigation system;
✔️ FOV setting slider;
✔️ New Game Over screen, when it is impossible to deliver the cargo;
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/41272375/f165d3c42bd864736c5dce7f977962e1bfec1bbd.gif

August 2022 - release of 1.00 version
✔️ Arcade mode 
✔️ Fourth Forklift
✔️ Steam Leaderboards support
✔️ Steam Achievements support
✔️ Bug fixes (economy + missions)

And now, we are finally here! You don't even know how happy we are and we hope you will enjoy Best Forklift Operator as well.

We hope this will be a game that you will come back to often, try it in VR, show it to younger and older players, get better results and paint your cart in your favorite color, and have fun with Arcade mode. Maybe even someone decides to get a real forklift certificate! 
IT'S FORKIN' TIME!
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1684670

We greet you warmly and we are at your disposal all the time! ❤️
~Gamedust Team

