Best Forklift Operator is now available in Early Access

Today, thanks to the combined forces of Setapp and Gamedust, we start our adventure with simulation games. In Best Forklift Operator, you will all be able to see what the work of a forklift operator looks like and experience unforgettable moments in yards and warehouses. We give you the game in a relatively early stage of development and we understand what is missing in it. The current game contains two forklifts and two warehouses with basic ideas for the mission's goals. 

Until the full version is released, we'll be adding a third warehouse, leaderboards, and a new Arcade mode that offer a completely different dimension to the gameplay. We hope that what is at the heart of the game - the atmosphere and the way of controlling the forklift  - will be satisfactory for you, and you will look forward to the next content updates with us.

We also remind you that a huge part of the fun of the game is the ability to run it entirely in Virtual Reality and this is also the way we recommend playing to fully appreciate its value and the challenge it offers.

The demo that we released during NextFest was very well received and gave us a lot of information, but wanting to ensure that all the elements were properly made - the work was extended.

So, going to the summary, what's included in the current version of Early Access are:
☑️ Realistic forklift driving model;
☑️ Play the whole game however you want - in VR or on the flat screen;
☑️ Two warehouse areas;
☑️ Two models of the forklift;
☑️ Five missions for each warehouse, with a basic structure + two missions in which experience is based on randomly generated cargo;
☑️ Basic economy;
☑️ Possibility to change the color of the forklift.

What will come with the next game updates:
💪 The third, new, largest warehouse space - connected to the loading yard;
💪 New and varied mission modes;
💪 Third (largest) forklift;
💪 Arcade mode;
💪 Leaderboards;
💪 Steam Achievements;

We have other ideas for the game, but we would also like to build the game with you - our community - as well. As always, we are waiting for your opinions and comments.

Join us and help us build the best forklift simulator on the market!
